Font data

`kernel/vga_font8x8.h` is derived from the `vgafont8` table in SeaBIOS. The
SeaBIOS source attributes the font package to Joseph Gil and states that the
individual fonts are public domain. The reference source used for provenance
is:

https://github.com/coreboot/seabios/blob/81ec9ec0bcf45df11fb7f98339ec9036b546fca0/vgasrc/vgafonts.c
